<title>USA: Hartmarx completes Plaid purchase.</title>
<headline>Hartmarx completes Plaid purchase.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hartmarx Corp said Wednesday it completed its purchase of certain assets of  Plaid Clothing Group Inc as approved by a recent bankruptcy court order.</p>
<p>Hartmarx received court approval to purchase the assets for a cash payment of $36 million, assumption of up to $7.1 million in accounts payable and other liabilities and a royalty payment of two percent of the first year sales of the acquired brands.  Plaid has been operating under Chapter 11 bankruptcy protection since July 1995.</p>
<p>Hartmarx produces and markets business, casual and golfing apparel under a number of brand names.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
